{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T13:31:18.768813", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Ensure the environment is in a fresh state\n  env.reset()\n  # Mapping from action names to integer indices\n  action_map = env.action_specs()\n  # The integer code for the \"USE\" action (collect/craft)\n  use_action = action_map.get(\"USE\")\n  # If for some reason the mapping is missing, fall back to the last action\n  if use_action is None:\n      use_action = max(action_map.values())\n  # Prepare the list of actions to return\n  action_sequence = []\n  # Limit the number of steps to the environment's maximum episode length\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 1000)\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      # Stop early if the task is already completed\n      if env._is_done():\n          break\n      # Try a USE action each step; this will collect any adjacent\n      # grabbable item or perform a craft when facing a workshop.\n      reward, done, _ = env.step(use_action)\n      action_sequence.append(use_action)\n      if done:\n          break\n  # Return the collected sequence of integer actions\n  return action_sequence", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": -1}}
