{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T13:32:24.811279", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Initialize the environment and collect actions using a simple random policy\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  done = False\n\n  # Retrieve the list of possible action indices from the environment's specification\n  action_indices = list(env.action_specs().values())\n\n  while not done:\n      # Choose a random action each step\n      act = np.random.choice(action_indices)\n      actions.append(act)\n\n      # Execute the action and observe the outcome\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(act)\n\n  # Return the sequence of actions taken to (attempt to) complete the task\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 4, "scores": {"3": -1}}
