{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T13:34:36.593963", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Map known obstacles to the tool required to break them.\n  obstacle_to_tool = {\n      \"tree\": \"axe\",\n      \"wood\": \"axe\",\n      \"stone\": \"pickaxe\",\n      \"rock\": \"pickaxe\",\n      \"water\": \"bucket\",\n  }\n\n  # Normalise obstacle name and fetch the corresponding tool.\n  tool_name = obstacle_to_tool.get(str(obstacle).lower())\n  if not tool_name:\n      # Unknown obstacle \u2013 nothing we can do.\n      return []\n\n  # Resolve the tool's index using the world cookbook.\n  tool_idx = env.world.cookbook.index[tool_name]\n  if tool_idx is None:\n      return []\n\n  # Check whether the tool is already in the agent's inventory.\n  inventory = env._current_state.inventory\n  if inventory[tool_idx] > 0:\n      # Assuming the obstacle is directly in front of the agent,\n      # a single USE action attempts to break it.\n      return [4]  # USE action\n  else:\n      # Tool not available \u2013 cannot break the obstacle now.\n      return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
