{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T13:40:19.773733", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n\n  # Determine a safe upper bound on steps (use env's max_steps if present)\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 1000)\n\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      # If the environment signals termination, stop generating actions\n      try:\n          if env._is_done():\n              break\n      except Exception:\n          # Fallback: rely on the `done` flag from the previous step\n          pass\n\n      # Sample a random valid action\n      a = int(np.random.randint(env.world.n_actions))\n\n      # Execute the action and collect the result\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(a)\n      actions.append(a)\n\n      # Stop if the episode has finished\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
