{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T13:46:50.763895", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  import numpy as np\n\n  # Reset environment to start a fresh episode\n  env.reset()\n  actions = []\n\n  # Determine step limit: use env.max_steps if present, else a default\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 500)\n\n  # Get list of possible action indices from the environment spec\n  # env.action_specs() returns a dict mapping action names to integers\n  action_dict = env.action_specs()\n  possible_actions = list(action_dict.values())\n  if not possible_actions:\n      # No defined actions; return empty list\n      return actions\n\n  # Execute random actions until episode ends or step limit reached\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      act = int(np.random.choice(possible_actions))\n      actions.append(act)\n      _, done, _ = env.step(act)\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": -1}}
