{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T13:59:26.366895", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Simple random policy: reset the environment and take random actions until the episode ends.\n  actions = []\n  env.reset()\n  # Get the list of possible action IDs from the environment specifications.\n  action_ids = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  # Safety limit to avoid infinite loops.\n  max_steps = 1000\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      # Sample a random action.\n      action = np.random.choice(action_ids)\n      actions.append(int(action))\n      # Execute the action.\n      _, done, _ = env.step(action)\n      if done:\n          break\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": -1}}
