{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T14:13:35.635484", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  env.reset()\n  # Gather the possible action indices from the environment specification\n  action_indices = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  # Container for the sequence of actions taken\n  action_sequence = []\n  # Safety cap to avoid infinite loops in pathological cases\n  MAX_STEPS = 2000\n  steps = 0\n  while steps < MAX_STEPS:\n      # Sample a random action from the allowed set\n      act = int(np.random.choice(action_indices))\n      # Execute the action; env.step returns (reward, done, observation)\n      _, done, _ = env.step(act)\n      # Record the action\n      action_sequence.append(act)\n      steps += 1\n      # Terminate if the episode reports completion\n      if done:\n          break\n  return action_sequence", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 9, "scores": {"3": -1}}
