{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T14:35:44.619085", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Access the current state of the environment\n  state = env._current_state\n\n  # Iterate over all non\u2011grabbable entity indices (obstacles) defined in the world\n  for obs_idx in state.world.non_grabbable_indices:\n      # Check whether the obstacle is in the 3\u00d73 neighbourhood of the agent\n      if state.next_to(obs_idx):\n          # Convert the obstacle index back to its string name using the Index helper\n          try:\n              obs_name = state.world.cookbook.index.get(obs_idx)\n          except Exception:\n              obs_name = None\n\n          # If we successfully retrieved a name, delegate to the generic breaking routine\n          if obs_name:\n              return break_func_v0(env, obs_name)\n\n  # No obstacle detected nearby \u2013 return an empty action list\n  return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": -1}}
