{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T14:56:13.539477", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  import numpy as np\n\n  # Reset the environment to get initial observation\n  _ = env.reset()\n\n  # Mapping from action names to integer indices\n  action_map = env.action_specs()\n  action_vals = list(action_map.values())\n\n  # Use the environment's max_steps if available, otherwise a default horizon\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 100)\n\n  actions = []\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      # Randomly pick an action and execute it\n      act = int(np.random.choice(action_vals))\n      actions.append(act)\n      _, done, _ = env.step(act)\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": -1}}
