{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T14:58:47.295777", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  actions = []\n  # Initialize the environment\n  env.reset()\n  # Mapping from action names to integer codes\n  action_map = env.action_specs()\n  action_vals = list(action_map.values())\n\n  # Simple random policy (stop when the episode ends or after a safety limit)\n  max_steps = 500\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      act = np.random.choice(action_vals)\n      actions.append(int(act))\n      _, done, _ = env.step(act)\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": -1}}
