{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T14:58:56.745733", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to obtain the initial observation and\n  # retrieve the mapping from action names to integer indices.\n  obs = env.reset()\n  action_spec = env.action_specs()\n  action_values = list(action_spec.values())\n\n  # Safety limit to avoid infinite loops in case the environment never\n  # reaches a terminal state.\n  MAX_STEPS = 1000\n\n  actions = []\n  done = False\n  for _ in range(MAX_STEPS):\n      # Choose a random legal action.\n      act = int(np.random.choice(action_values))\n      actions.append(act)\n\n      # Execute the action in the environment.\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(act)\n\n      # Stop if the episode has terminated.\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
