{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T15:01:30.207762", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  import numpy as np\n\n  # Reset the environment to start a new episode.\n  _ = env.reset()\n\n  # Get the list of available action IDs.\n  action_ids = list(env.action_specs().values())\n\n  actions = []\n  MAX_STEPS = 500  # Prevent infinite loops.\n\n  for _ in range(MAX_STEPS):\n      # Choose a random action.\n      act = int(np.random.choice(action_ids))\n      actions.append(act)\n\n      # Execute the action.\n      _, done, _ = env.step(act)\n\n      # Stop if the episode is finished.\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": -1}}
