{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T15:14:06.671496", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  \"\"\"\n  No-op policy for the Craft environment.\n  Returns an empty list of actions (i.e., does nothing).\n  \"\"\"\n  # Optionally reset the environment to a fresh start.\n  try:\n      env.reset()\n  except Exception:\n      # If the environment does not support reset or has already been reset,\n      # we simply ignore the error.\n      pass\n\n  # No actions to take.\n  return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
