{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T15:19:36.806786", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Return a zero-filled placeholder vector matching the environment's feature size.\n  # If the environment is None or its size cannot be determined, return an empty array.\n  if env is None:\n      return np.array([], dtype=np.float32)\n\n  # Determine the appropriate vector length.\n  size = None\n  if hasattr(env, \"world\"):\n      if hasattr(env.world, \"n_features\"):\n          size = env.world.n_features\n      elif hasattr(env.world, \"n_kinds\"):\n          size = env.world.n_kinds\n  if size is None:\n      size = getattr(env, \"n_features\", None)\n\n  if size is None:\n      # Unable to infer size; return empty placeholder.\n      return np.array([], dtype=np.float32)\n\n  return np.zeros(size, dtype=np.float32)", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 0, "scores": {"3": -1}}
