{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T15:20:41.020501", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  import random\n\n  # Reset the environment to get the initial observation\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  done = False\n\n  # Obtain the list of possible action IDs\n  action_ids = list(env.action_specs().values())\n\n  # Simple random policy: keep taking random actions until the episode ends\n  # or a safety limit on the number of steps is reached.\n  max_steps = 1000\n  steps = 0\n  while not done and steps < max_steps:\n      a = random.choice(action_ids)\n      actions.append(a)\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(a)\n      steps += 1\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
