{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T15:20:53.192670", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  actions = []\n  # Get the set of possible action indices from the environment.\n  try:\n      action_dict = env.action_specs()\n      action_vals = list(action_dict.values())\n  except Exception:\n      # Default to the five canonical actions if the environment does not expose specs.\n      action_vals = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]\n\n  max_steps = 1000  # safety cap to avoid infinite loops\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      # Choose a random action from the available actions.\n      act = np.random.choice(action_vals)\n\n      # Execute the action; handle both possible return signatures.\n      try:\n          reward, done, _ = env.step(int(act))\n      except Exception:\n          result = env.step(int(act))\n          if isinstance(result, tuple) and len(result) == 3:\n              reward, done, _ = result\n          else:\n              # If the environment does not follow the expected API, assume not done.\n              done = False\n\n      actions.append(int(act))\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
