{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T15:26:07.204312", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  actions = []\n  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  env.reset()\n  # Get the mapping from action names to integer codes\n  action_map = env.action_specs()\n  action_vals = list(action_map.values())\n  # Define a safety limit on steps to avoid infinite loops\n  max_steps = 1000\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      # Choose a random valid action\n      act = np.random.choice(action_vals)\n      actions.append(int(act))\n      # Execute the action in the environment\n      _, done, _ = env.step(act)\n      # Stop if the episode has terminated (goal reached or max steps)\n      if done:\n          break\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": -1}}
