{"timestamp": "2025-11-05T15:26:51.487349", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Try the basic breaking strategy first.\n  try:\n      actions = break_func_v0(env, obstacle)\n      if actions:\n          return actions\n  except Exception:\n      # If the basic strategy fails (e.g., missing tool), fall back to the improved version.\n      pass\n\n  # Attempt the improved breaking strategy.\n  try:\n      actions = break_func_v1(env, obstacle)\n      if actions:\n          return actions\n  except Exception:\n      # If both strategies fail, we cannot break the obstacle.\n      pass\n\n  # Return an empty list to indicate that no sequence of actions can break the obstacle.\n  return []", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": -1}}
